WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.911
A reflection is a mirror image across a line. Every point stays the same distance

00:00:04.911 --> 00:00:05.853
from the line.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:12.584
Reflect (8, 3) in the y-axis. The answer is (-8, 3). Reflection in the y-axis changes

00:00:12.584 --> 00:00:14.423
the sign of x only.

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:20.177
A point during a library project has coordinates (7, 2). Reflect it across the

00:00:20.177 --> 00:00:24.371
vertical y-axis. What is the new point? Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.211
A point during a library project has coordinates (7, 2). Reflect it across the

00:00:30.211 --> 00:00:35.580
vertical y-axis. What is the new point? The answer is (-7, 2). Reflection in the

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.085
y-axis changes the sign of x only.
